    <div id="context_history_container" class="body_panel">
      <br/>
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0px;" title="Dates of context use in pipeline">Context History (<a href="/display_context_history/" class="tdlabel" style="font-size: 0.8em;" title="Complete history of default contexts">more history,</a>&nbsp;<a href="/display_all_contexts/" class="tdlabel" style="font-size: 0.8em;" title="Table of all contexts">all contexts</a>,&nbsp;<a href="/display_build_contexts/" class="tdlabel" style="font-size: 0.8em;" title="Table of cal sw build contexts">build contexts</a>)</h3>
      



<div id="context_history" style="background-color: #EEEEEE;">
    <table border="1" width="100%" class="ctx">
        <thead class="ctx">
            <tr class="ctx">
                <th width="8%" class="center bold tdlabel ctx">Start Date</th>
                <th width="8%" class="center bold tdlabel ctx">Context</th>
                <th width="8%" class="center bold tdlabel ctx">Status</th>
                <th width="56%" class="center bold tdlabel ctx">Description</th>
                
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="ctx">
            
            <tr class="ctx">
                <td class="center ctx">2026-09-10</td>
                <td class="center ctx"><a href="/context_table/jwst_1596.pmap">jwst_1596.pmap</a></td>
                <td class="center ctx darkgold">latest</td>
                <td class="left ctx">Affected data -- NIRCam coronagraphic F070W, F090W, F115W, and F150W modes, DHS and weak lens, psfmask and filteroffset reference files.
These new psfmask reference files are the initial files to support pipeline processing for the bluest NIRCam filters when used for coronagraphic observations. These are copies of the existing psfmask reference files for the F210M filter, which have not had any filter-dependent shift added. These files will be updated once commissioning data are used to determine the filter-dependent shifts.
These updated NIRCam filteroffset ref